flowchart TD
    L[Dashboard] --> M[Select Channel]
    M --> N[Compose Message]
    N --> O{Attachment?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Upload to S3]
    O -- No --> Q
    P --> Q[Send Message]
    Q --> R[Message Persisted]
    R --> S[WebSocket Broadcast]
    S --> T{Recipient Online?}
    T -- Yes --> U[Show Message + Reset Unread]
    T -- No --> V[Increment Unread + Push Notification]